MzI2NTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58326584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535","html_url":"https://github.com/tp1415926535","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tp1415926535/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T06:57:15Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T06:57:15Z","body":"I can also reproduce this on Windows. The same path maps to:\n```text\nC:\\Users\\<user>\\AppData\\Roaming\\Godot\\app_userdata\\<project>\\logs\\godot.log\n```\n\nIn my case the logs folder grew to about 30 GB and filled the system drive. A maximum log file size or total log folder size limit would be very useful, especially for C# projects where repeated errors include large stack traces.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4418228417/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]